# Never send secrets, keys, local data or build output to the Docker daemon.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/var/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.db
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
infrastructure/nginx/certs/
agent/
documentation/
.git/
